\ Regression: values created at binary runtime and stored into
\ image-materialized module-private container state must be released at
\ context teardown. The debug allocator in the linked runtime reports any
\ missed release on stderr, which this fixture catches through its stderr
\ golden. The program exits by falling off the end; `sys-exit` would skip
\ teardown and mask the check.
use "./support/private_state.1z" ;

populate-state
cache-value inspect print-line
registry-runtime inspect print-line
registry-pinned-tag inspect print-line
